      "headline": "AI/ML | AI Engineer | RAG | LLM | Langchain | Langgraph | Agentic AI",
      "about": "Generative AI Engineer with 5+ years of experience building data-driven systems and deploying AI-powered solutions in production environments. My work focuses on designing scalable and reliable architectures that enable organizations to transform enterprise data into actionable insights using Generative AI technologies.I specialize in developing Large Language Model (LLM) applications, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines, and AI agent-based systems that support real-world business workflows. These systems integrate structured and unstructured data to improve knowledge retrieval, analytics, and decision-making across enterprise platforms.My expertise includes Python, SQL, NLP, and data engineering, along with hands-on experience integrating LLMs into business applications using prompt engineering, vector search systems, and retrieval pipelines. I also design AI agents and agentic workflows that can orchestrate multi-step tasks, interact with APIs and enterprise tools, and automate complex processes across systems.I have worked on projects involving LLM-based SQL query generation, AI-powered analytics platforms, and NLP pipelines for information extraction and data standardization. These solutions help organizations improve data accessibility, automate repetitive tasks, and generate insights more efficiently.A key focus of my work is designing Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) architectures, combining language models with vector databases and enterprise knowledge sources to deliver context-aware responses grounded in trusted data. I also build AI agent systems capable of reasoning over enterprise data and executing workflow-driven tasks, enabling intelligent automation at scale.In addition to model development, I focus on the productionization of AI systems, including pipeline design, model integration, monitoring, and performance optimization. My goal is to build AI platforms that are scalable, reliable, and suitable for enterprise production environments.I am particularly interested in building scalable, explainable, and responsible AI systems, leveraging LLMs, RAG architectures, and AI agents to help organizations unlock the full potential of their data and automation capabilities.",
