                "text": "Spearheading the architecture and deployment of enterprise Generative AI solutions at Wipro, focusing on building scalable and production-ready AI systems that integrate advanced language models with enterprise data platforms and business applications. Designing end-to-end AI architectures that leverage Large Language Models (LLMs), Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines, and agentic AI workflows to enable intelligent automation and natural language interaction with enterprise systems.\n\nLeading the development of LLM-powered applications and AI agents capable of orchestrating workflows across multiple tools, APIs, and enterprise data sources. These systems combine vector search technologies, contextual retrieval pipelines, and prompt engineering to deliver reliable and context-aware responses while reducing hallucinations and improving output accuracy.\n\nDesigning agent-based AI systems that retrieve information, reason over enterprise knowledge bases, and execute multi-step tasks to support business processes. These agentic workflows enable automation of activities such as knowledge discovery, document processing, data querying, and operational decision support.\n\nCollaborating with cross-functional teams to integrate Generative AI capabilities into enterprise platforms, enabling users to interact with systems through natural language interfaces and intelligent assistants. Responsible for building cloud-native architectures that support scalable AI workloads while ensuring system reliability and maintainability.\n\nDriving the productionization of AI solutions by implementing pipelines for data ingestion, model orchestration, monitoring, and performance optimization. Delivering Generative AI platforms that combine LLMs, RAG architectures, and intelligent agents to improve operational efficiency, scalability, and real-world adoption of AI in enterprise environments."
